200	- [x] Task 3: Frontend — `BookingSelectionService` route-gescoped bereitstellen (AC: #4)
201	  - [x] `booking.ts`: `BookingSelectionService` importieren, `providers: [BookingSelectionService]` im `@Component`-Decorator ergänzen (Komponenten-Provider-Scope = eine frische Service-Instanz je `BookingPage`-Instanz, d. h. je Navigation zu einer neuen Buchungsstrecke; erfüllt "routen-gescopt" aus AC #4, ohne einen Router-Level-Provider zu benötigen, den es in diesem Projekt sonst nirgends gibt):
202	    ```typescript
203	    import { Component, inject, signal } from '@angular/core';
204	    import { ActivatedRoute } from '@angular/router';
205	    import { HttpErrorResponse } from '@angular/common/http';
206	
207	    import { EventsApiService } from '../../core/api/events-api.service';
208	    import { SeatMap } from '../../core/api/seat-map';
209	    import { SeatMapGrid } from './seat-map/seat-map';
210	    import { BookingSelectionService } from './booking-selection.service';
211	
